translation.en:
October a. pr., of the 21st of January a. c., and of the arrangement verbally made with the interested parties on that account, a term is appointed for today for the taking up of the purchase contract agreed between the Prince Hohenlohe Ingelfingen and the Bank Director Leixner at Franckfurth a/O. concerning the estates Kolno and Kaemen, of the District of Posen. At this term there appeared

1, on the part of the vendor

a, as his Mandatarius the Justice Councillor Melzer, who legitimated himself by the special power of attorney already in actis, granted to him for this Actus;

b, the General Mandatarius of the Prince, the Building Councillor Glenk, already personally known to the undersigned;

